WEBVTT

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:03.900
That's right...

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.810
Having been possessed by the demon sword,

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:11.110
he cut down all of his bandit comrades on the ship.

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:19.080
The man licked the blood from the sword and said this to the policemen who came rushing toward him:

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:25.500
Blood! Give me more blood, you scum!

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:26.710
What are you talking about?

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.340
Ah, Mikan!

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:31.550
Zastin is telling us about a cursed sword!

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:33.720
A cursed sword...?

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:38.890
Oh, I'm talking about a frightful sword that
turns its possessor into a dreadful killer.

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:40.770
Wow, that's so over the top.

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:41.850
Is that a true story?

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:47.230
Well, when I was in the great war, I fought on many planets,

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.230
but I never saw the real thing.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:52.150
I guess it's what you would call an urban legend.

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:57.450
Actually, I was thinking about pitching a series on that subject.

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:01.200
Is he a swordsman or a manga writer?

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:04.960
A curse, so childish huh?

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:06.040
Yeah.

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:09.090
I wondered who it was trembling behind Rito-san the whole time.

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:11.630
I-I wasn't trembling!

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:14.880
Hey, hey! Don't fight!

