00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:52.270
<b>「Danger</b>

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:52.270
<b>「Danger</b>

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:52.270
<b>~Peril~」</b>

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:52.270
<b>~Peril~」</b>

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:55.650
Welcome, Yuuki Mika-

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:57.820
Wait, why is Yuuki Rito here?!

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:01.030
I thought I told you to call his responsible little sister!

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:02.990
I'm sorry, Saki-sama.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:06.200
It seems Mikan was busy and unable to come,

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.250
so she sent him in her place.

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:10.080
I guess I don't have any choice.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:13.630
It's my fault that it turned out like this in the first place.

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:16.420
Have you heard the circumstances from Mikan?

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:17.760
Uh, yes.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:24.800
Last night Tenjouin-senpai cooked
for the house servants to thank them,

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:27.560
and they all ended up unable to move from stomach pain.

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:28.930
That's right.

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:35.270
It was so sudden, and it's difficult for only Aya and myself to fill in for all the people we're missing.

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:37.530
Please do your best for today.

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:38.980
We'll pay you for your work.

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:40.110
Okay.

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:43.280
But will it be okay with only me...?

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:45.830
There's no need to worry, Rito-san!

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:48.950
We're helping out as well!

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:51.210
Momo! Everyone!

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:52.870
Why are you here?!

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:57.040
It seemed difficult for you to do it alone, so I brought everyone!

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:58.090
And also...

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:03.430
Tenjouin-san is always taking care of Onee-sama,
so I thought it would be nice if I could lend a hand.

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:07.350
Oh! For Lala's little sister, you're very thoughtful!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:08.850
Wow!

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:12.850
You look so mature in those clothes Senpai, it's wonderful!

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:16.980
I'm borrowing this from here, but what about all of you?

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:18.980
Momo prepared them.

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:22.610
She said the maid outfits here were too plain and had no sex appea-?!

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:26.200
Oh my, what are you saying?

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:33.500
Stop... my... m-my tail! {etc, Nana throughout Momo's tailjob}

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:31.040
I just did it so that Tenjouin-san
wouldn't have to be concerned about it.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:37.630
Don't-!

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:40.630
I have a bad feeling!

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:46.140
Eh?

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:52.890
Hey! Get away from Saki-sama!

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:52.890
My body belongs to Zastin-sama!

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:54.100
I'm sorry!

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:56.150
It wasn't Rito-san's fault!

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:59.150
We really shouldn't have brought Yuuki Rito here, after all. {Can't hear a damn thing other than Aya while she's talking}

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:01.690
Good grief...

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:03.820
Why do I have to do something like this?

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:04.950
It's fine, isn't it?

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:08.990
Being a real maid isn't something you can experience often.

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:10.530
Right, Yami-oneechan?

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.790
That's right.

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:14.710
I can earn money for taiyaki, too.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:20.090
But isn't cleaning a huge mansion like this a pain?

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:21.210
That's true.

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:21.920
Eh?

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:32.100
Amazing!

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:33.350
As expected of trans!

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:36.440
It's more efficient this way.

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:38.190
Why don't you do it as well, Mea?

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:38.810
Eh?

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:39.980
Oh! Do it, do it!

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:42.480
Hmm...

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:45.440
It looks fun, but I'll pass.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:46.700
Why?

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:52.080
If I use trans and they find out my identity, it would be bad.

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:57.000
Are you still keeping it a secret that you're Yami's little sister?

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:57.750
Yeah.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:01.460
I promised Master I'd live like an Earthling.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:04.300
You don't have to worry about that anymore, do you?

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:05.510
That may be so.

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:09.590
It's not like Master is strictly stopping me, but...

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:10.340
Hm?

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:14.970
What I'm worried about is if my identity is revealed to everyone,

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:18.730
will I be able to continue going to school like I have until now?

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:27.240
Using trans really makes you hungry, doesn't it?

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:29.820
I think I'll clean normally as well, after all.

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:35.540
This room is done, so why don't we go somewhere else?

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:39.460
Yeah!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:48.420
Here you go, have some tea.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:50.090
Thank you, Momo.

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:54.140
By the way, this painting... is that Zastin-san?

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.640
Yes! I painted it.

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:59.350
It's a painting overflowing with my love for him.

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:01.440
It's wonderful, isn't it?

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.730
Ah, yeah...

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:06.440
Ah, Zastin-sama!

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:09.740
My heart is yours for eternity!

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:11.320
As expected of Saki-sama!

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:14.030
I'll stay with you my whole life!

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:20.410
It may be a little difficult to add these people to Rito-san's harem...

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:25.340
In which case, the one I should be concerned with is Kujou Rin-san.

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:30.130
The way she stays inseparably close to
Tenjouin-san at all times, that faithfulness.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:33.720
If I could get her to direct that to Rito-san...

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:41.020
Rito-sama, I will guard you while you sleep.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:44.770
You never know when someone insolent will try to target you.

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:51.650
Candy!

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:52.320
R-Rito-sama!

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:52.820
It's candy!

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:53.780
Ah!

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:56.080
Delicious-looking candy!

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:57.990
I can't-

00:07:57.990 --> 00:07:58.740
Candy!

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.790
Oh, there's candy here, too!

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:02.540
Candy! Candy! {etc}

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:05.750
Master!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:06.670
That's right!

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:10.550
It's the forbidden relationship that crosses the master-servant boundaries!

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:14.260
Oh. No, no!

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:18.390
I can't decide on that until I know Rin-san has at least some feelings for Rito-san.

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:24.100
That looks like some really big luggage.

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:27.520
It's something that just arrived for Saki-sama's father's collection.

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:31.190
If it needs to be taken somewhere, how about I do it?

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:33.570
No. I can't leave it to you.

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:34.780
I'll do it later.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:37.030
That's what I thought.

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.950
You're just too dangerous.

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:42.450
As Saki-sama's guard, I can't let you come close to her anymore.

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:43.870
Yes.

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:44.540
Hm?

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.420
What is it?

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:49.710
Ah, it's nothing.

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:54.130
I was just thinking it's unusual to see you dressed like that, Kujou-senpai.

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:57.720
That girl Momo forced me to wear it.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:01.270
I don't really understand her, just as Mikan said.

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:01.270
Go on.

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:04.850
There's no way clothes like this would suit me.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:06.650
That's not true!

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:08.610
I think they suit you very well!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.230
Because you're very pretty, Senpai.

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:13.530
Don't say strange things!

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:15.610
Ah! No, no! I didn't mean it in a strange way!

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:17.820
As expected of Rito-san!

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:21.370
It's frightening how he can say things like that so naturally.

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:23.410
Good grief...

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:26.120
Ah, I'll pick it up!

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:28.960
As if I'll let you! {as if you could counter Rito's epic falls}

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:42.930
You damn brute!

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:47.060
He finally got some points with her, too...!

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:52.110
Good grief, why are you like that?

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:54.110
I-I'm sorry.

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:55.570
That's enough here.

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.570
Why don't you go organise the study or something?

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:58.610
Yes.

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:07.660
I have to clean this up.

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:11.380
Hm?

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:17.380
Ah...

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.840
That's too much work, I'm tired!

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:21.890
But it's more or less finished, right?

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:23.760
So, where's Yami?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:26.560
She said she was going to the study since we had a break.

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:30.100
As usual, she really loves books.

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:31.610
Mea.

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:34.320
Master!

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.700
What are you looking at?

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:42.370
Over there, Master is...

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:42.950
Eh?!

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:44.160
Huh...?

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.370
W-Where?

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:46.870
There's nothing there.

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:50.080
Master is so shy.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:07.980
Seconds!

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:11.900
Mikan, your cooking is the best after all!

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:13.610
Good grief...

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:17.070
My hands are already full taking care of the house and Rito.

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:18.570
I know.

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:20.950
I'm so happy to have a responsible daughter!

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.950
By the way, what's with those clothes?

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:25.240
Oh, this?

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.450
I got it from Momo-san!

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:33.330
At first I wasn't interested, but when I
tried it on, it felt like a combat uniform!

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:35.170
I get my housework finished up in a flash!

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:35.880
Oh!

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:37.880
So it's a form making the function thing?

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:39.550
I understand that.

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:41.470
When I wear this "big catch" headband,

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:45.510
my mood becomes intense and I make lots of progress with my work.

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:49.020
I'm not sure I like it being compared with that...

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:51.230
Commander Zastin.

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:52.020
What is it?

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:55.520
We have received information on a dangerous individual on Earth.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:03.280
I wonder if Rito is doing well?

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.990
I made Kujou-senpai angry again.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:11.210
It's okay.

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:14.420
She should know that you don't have any bad intentions.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:15.960
But, still...

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:19.800
So what do you think of Rin-san, Rito-san?

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:20.510
Eh?

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:25.970
If you want me to, I'll work to direct her feelings toward you.

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:28.680
How did it come to that?!

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:33.810
Kujou-senpai!

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:36.560
Give me blood...

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:40.110
Senpai! I understand why you're angry, but that's too dangerous!

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:41.190
Rito-san!

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:43.610
Momo!

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:47.070
I was almost turned into a washboard!

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:58.290
Give me... blood.

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:03.090
K-Kujou-senpai, your panties are... No, I mean...

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:06.050
Yami-san!

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:07.800
Looks like you're having a fight.

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:11.220
What kind of perverted thing did you do to make her angry?

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:11.810
Eh?!

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:15.810
No, this is...

00:13:16.140 --> 00:13:18.810
It seems kind of noisy in the mansion.

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:20.270
I wonder what's going on?

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:23.990
Y-You guys...

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:29.950
You! What did you do to make her angry?!

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:33.580
Have you realised it, Mea?

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:34.870
This bloodlust.

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.370
Rather than Kujou Rin herself,

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:38.710
it's emanating more strongly from that sword.

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:41.340
That red blade.

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:43.210
That is most likely the demon sword, Bladix.

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:45.300
If I remember correctly, that was...

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:46.470
The cursed sword!

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:47.720
So it was true, then?

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:49.010
Yes.

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:52.470
However, Bladix is not a cursed sword.

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:56.180
It's a parasitic metallic life-form.

00:13:56.180 --> 00:14:01.480
I believe it was an experimental weapon created in another galaxy around 2,000 years ago.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:07.360
It's a demon sword that uses blood as an energy source and
makes any human that it takes possession of fight until they die.

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:10.780
It's another dangerous product of the great galactic war.

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:15.370
This is something an Earthling won't be able to dodge!

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:16.120
Rito-san!

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:19.500
He's dodging it by a hair's breadth?!

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:22.290
What do we do?

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:25.800
Since the opponent is Senpai, we can't counter-attack!

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.630
Ah... Ah!

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:28.880
Stay away, you idiots!

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:36.680
Wa-

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:40.600
Nana-chan!

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:53.870
Are you all right, Nana!?

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:56.410
Ah... y-yeah...

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:01.790
Ah...

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.250
Don't say I'm flat-chested!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:04.670
I didn't!

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:06.670
What's going on?!

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:09.930
Father's study is a mess!

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:11.550
Rin? Where is Rin?

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:14.430
I don't see Yuuki Rito or the others, either!

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:15.970
What's going on?

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:17.430
This is...

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:20.190
I had a bad feeling, so I came, but...

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:22.190
Zastin-sama!

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.400
My! Why are you here?

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:25.440
Eh?

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:28.490
Tenjouin Saki-dono, right?

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:31.200
I'm sorry to come in without permission.

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:40.410
Even if I attack at this level, I can't knock the sword away.

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:45.090
In that case, the only way to free her from the sword's control is...

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:48.420
...to destroy it!

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:51.170
You shouldn't do that, Onee-chan.

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:56.930
The way that sword is controlling Kujou-senpai is probably something close to my way of doing it.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:00.810
Psycho Dive's ultimate ability, Body Jack.

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:04.440
The power to steal the target's ability to control their body.

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:10.820
Kujou-senpai is synchronised with the sword, so if you destroy it, her heart will be destroyed as well.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:13.570
W-What would happen?

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:16.030
Her broken heart would never heal.

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:19.330
Kujou-senpai would never regain her consciousness.

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:20.580
That can't be...!

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:22.580
Then what do we do?

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:25.920
Mea!

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:27.630
Oh, you surprised me!

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:29.630
That serious expression!

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:32.010
Could it be you're going to lick me?!

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:33.010
That's not it!

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:34.590
I have something to ask of you.

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:38.970
Use your ability to connect my heart with Kujou-senpai's.

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:41.270
I'm going to separate that sword from Senpai!

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:45.520
Are you serious?

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:52.240
Bladix is controlling Kujou-senpai's consciousness right now.

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:56.110
If you're not careful enough, your heart will be torn to pieces.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:58.620
Are you determined enough to take that risk?

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:02.750
Kujou-senpai saved Mikan once.

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:05.830
That's plenty of reason for me to risk my life for her.

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:09.130
Fine, then.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:11.380
In that case, let me go too!

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:12.300
No.

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:14.090
Rito-senpai has to do it alone.

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:16.590
If you insist that much, then prove it to me.

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:18.970
It'll be okay, Momo.

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:20.810
I'll manage somehow with my spirit.

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:23.810
I have to do at least this much once in a while.

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:28.810
It's like my body doesn't belong to me.

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:32.320
What in the world...

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:35.490
...am I doing?

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:38.780
Mea!

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:41.700
Here I go!

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:50.380
This is inside of Kujou-senpai's heart?

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:52.420
It's really dark.

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:59.470
This sensation is...

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:02.140
Y-Yuuki Rito!

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:03.350
What are you doing?!

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:05.060
I-I'm sorry!

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:06.310
What is this place?

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:07.310
What's going on with me?

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:12.650
Damn it!

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:13.730
I'll get you loose!

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:23.200
Who the hell are you?

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:28.250
There's someone other than me that can
access a living organism's consciousness?

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.960
That's the demon sword's true nature!

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:32.590
You're pissing me off!

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:35.880
Trying to take back this girl's consciousness that I finally got hold of!

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:39.930
Not to mention I was already irritated
because I couldn't cut anything but cloth!

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.800
I'll take control of you as well now!

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:44.640
I'll make you regret it!

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:49.310
That a mere human like you laid a finger on my possession!

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:51.440
Your possession?!

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:52.560
Eh?!

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:54.110
Don't screw with me!

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:56.570
This is Kujou-senpai's heart!

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:58.700
It doesn't belong to you!

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:01.700
I know all about it!

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:05.660
That Kujou-senpai has people who she holds more dearly than anything else!

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:09.460
She must be thinking of those people inside her heart all the time!

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:15.090
That you would take control of her heart and treat it like your belonging...!

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:16.960
I won't let you do it!

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:24.050
I'm the daughter of Kujou Kai from the steward agency, Kujou Rin.

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:27.430
I will be serving you from now on, Saki-sama.

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:33.860
Make sure you protect me properly. Okay, Rin?

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:37.730
I've always protected her.

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:41.990
The relationship between the Tenjouin and Kujou families was nothing more than an excuse.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:47.580
I always wanted to be the one to protect Saki-sama.

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:50.870
Because I am a person who protects.

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:54.750
And this boy is trying to protect me...?

00:19:55.130 --> 00:19:56.210
That's it!

00:19:56.210 --> 00:19:58.000
I'll send Rito in my place!

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:00.010
Yuuki Rito?

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:01.130
It's okay.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:03.340
He may be like that,

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:06.390
but when you're really in trouble he's a reliable person.

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:14.350
W-Why, you...!

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:18.270
Well done, Senpai!

00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:19.320
You did a great job.

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:21.570
Mea!

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:24.780
Oh?

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:25.780
It's pointless...

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:29.290
...to try to encroach into my heart.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:36.580
What's with her?!

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:37.790
I'm being taken over instead...!

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:41.170
The sword ...

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.050
...It's separated!

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:42.970
Damn it!

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:45.930
I finally found a body with the right wavelength and it turned out like this!

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:49.510
I have to find another body!

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:52.770
It's bedtime for you.

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:53.980
Rito-san!

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.980
Rito, are you okay?

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:57.940
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:20:57.940 --> 00:20:59.900
Not you, I mean her!

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:04.070
There's nothing to worry about.

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:09.780
She's been freed from Bladix's control, so she'll wake up shortly.

00:21:09.780 --> 00:21:11.580
Thanks to Senpai.

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:13.200
No. Mea, you...

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:15.710
Wait, what was with your hair colour just before...?

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:16.960
Hm?

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:20.380
It's hard to come out now.

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:24.380
It looks like it's been resolved without my appearance.

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:27.220
I'm glad that Momo-sama and the others are safe, but...

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:31.970
What bothers me is that red-haired girl.

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:34.730
Her abilities were just like Golden Darkness'.

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:38.610
Is she a friend of Nana-sama or Momo-sama?

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:42.440
An alien wanting to conceal their identity isn't unusual on this planet, after all.

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:45.530
Zastin-sama, wait for me!

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:47.410
You!

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:49.700
Why are you showing up now, you good for nothing?!

00:21:49.920 --> 00:21:50.780
Wait!

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:54.950
Wait, Zastin-sama!

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:54.950
I'm so sorry!

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:13.260
<b>niwasaki yureru hana ga tsun to senobi de kotaeru</b>

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:13.260
<b>庭先揺れる花がツンと背伸びで応える</b>

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:13.260
<b>The flower swaying in the garden answers by stretching up</b>

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:18.900
<b>tsumasakidachi de asa ni ohayou no kisu</b>

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:18.900
<b>つま先立ちで朝におはようのKiss</b>

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:18.900
<b>To give a good morning kiss standing on tiptoes</b>

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:21.820
<b>saa yukou</b>

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:21.820
<b>さあ行こう</b>

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:21.820
<b>Now let's go!</b>

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:28.610
<b>fui ni tsumujikaze omowazu shagamikomu</b>

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:28.610
<b>不意につむじ風思わずしゃがみ込む</b>

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:28.610
<b>Caught off guard by the sudden whirlwind, I reflexively crouch down</b>

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:40.920
<b>fuwari sukaato ni kakushita yowasatsuyoku haratte miseta</b>

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:40.920
<b>ふわりスカートに隠した弱さ 強く払ってみせた</b>

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:40.920
<b>I firmly brush off the weakness hidden inside my skirt</b>

00:22:41.790 --> 00:22:49.970
<b>fuzoroi de sainan na nichijou ni sakihokorou</b>

00:22:41.790 --> 00:22:49.970
<b>不揃いで災難な日常に咲き誇ろう</b>

00:22:41.790 --> 00:22:49.970
<b>Let's bloom to our fullest in this strange everyday life full of misfortune</b>

00:22:50.130 --> 00:22:58.140
<b>sunao ni sodatanai kara chanto mitenakucha</b>

00:22:50.130 --> 00:22:58.140
<b>素直に育たないからちゃんと見てなくちゃ</b>

00:22:50.130 --> 00:22:58.140
<b>I can't be honest, so you have to pay close attention</b>

00:22:57.890 --> 00:23:06.150
<b>tameratta ano omoi sotto tsuchi ni umetanda</b>

00:22:57.890 --> 00:23:06.150
<b>躊躇ったあの想いそっと土に埋めたんだ</b>

00:22:57.890 --> 00:23:06.150
<b>I carefully buried the memory of my hesitance in the soil</b>

00:23:05.900 --> 00:23:12.410
<b>A flower blooming in your heart</b>

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:17.700
<b>sono hi o yume mite</b>

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:17.700
<b>その日を夢見て</b>

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:17.700
<b>I dream of that day</b>

